 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ b (lane kit-batch-2005b-20261122), hand-authored from the archived crops. Group 0 = panel 19 (SE, 43.1 m) from w02-136 2019-02-11 (sunlit and partly washed out): 14 modules of 3.1 m, a white-framed wide-plus-narrow window pair in each on all four storeys. Group 1 = panel 4 (SW, 24.9 m) from w04-226 2018-12-11 (shade, bare trees in front): the same, 8 modules. Groups 2-4 = the gable panels 23 (NE, from w08-46 2022-05-18), 6 (SE, from w09-136 2019-02-11) and 5 (SW, from w10-226L 2019-02-11): blank pale panels with one small window column beside the spiral stair. The long NW and courtyard walls take otherWalls.",
  "Not modelled: the galvanised spiral escape stairs on every gable and the braced steel posts between the module blocks (kit gap), the orange awnings."
 ],
